+# [STRUCTURAL] Tiered rest-of-Canada biomass supply. Four incremental technologies
+# inject into the national BCW pool; their activity caps and variable costs are
+# scenario inputs owned by the FRESH/WS3 supply-curve builder. The base parameter
+# build therefore creates the technologies and their output ratios but deliberately
+# leaves caps and costs absent, so a bare `osecan build-params` cannot dispatch them.
+TieredBiomassSupply = ("SUPBCWT1", "SUPBCWT2", "SUPBCWT3", "SUPBCWT4")
+
